---
title: Gallery
description: Photography and visual sketches from road trips, trails, and quiet moments.
permalink: /gallery/
---
<main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-16">
  <header class="mb-12 max-w-2xl">
    <div class="ec-kicker mb-2">Beyond Code</div>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
      Gallery
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      Travel. Click. Design. Repeat. Frames and visual experiments collected from trails and road trips.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section data-carousel aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Photo gallery">
    <div data-carousel-track class="ec-mobile-carousel-track ec-gallery-masonry">
      {% for img in collections.gallery %}
        <figure data-carousel-slide
                data-orientation="{{ img.orientation }}"
                {% if img.orientation == "landscape" %}style="--slide-bg: url('{{ img.url }}')"{% endif %}
                class="ec-mobile-carousel-slide ec-gallery-item">
          <img src="{{ img.url }}"
               width="{{ img.width }}"
               height="{{ img.height }}"
               alt="{{ img.alt }}"
               loading="lazy"
               decoding="async"
               class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl block">
        </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% set carouselTotal = collections.gallery.length %}
    {% include "_carousel_controls.njk" %}
  </section>
</main>
